    "biography": {
      "concept": "T2 boss · revenant. The ferryman who drowned with his passengers when the Drowned South went under, and who has run the crossing every night since. He takes the fare. He does not deliver anyone.",
      "notes": "When the waters took the flooded towns there was one ferry still running, and the ferryman would not leave while there were fares on the bank. The boat went down with eleven aboard. He still comes at dusk, pole in hand, lantern lit, and he still asks for the fare, and the people of the Drowned South still pay it because the alternative is to be rowed. The Evil Bad Faction tolerates him; Lady Ralph Maccio has twice tried to hire him and twice been told the fare. He is not angry. He is punctual."
    }
  },
